<title>USA: TENNIS-ORDER OF PLAY FOR U.S. V NETHERLANDS DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ORDER OF PLAY FOR U.S. V NETHERLANDS DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, California 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Order of</p>
<p>play for this weekend's Davis Cup tennis World Group</p>
<p>quarter-final tie between the United States and the</p>
<p>Netherlands as determined by Thursday's draw:</p>
<p>Friday</p>
<p>Andre Agassi (U.S.) v Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands)</p>
<p>Jim Courier (U.S.) v Jan Siemerink (Netherlands)</p>
<p>Saturday (doubles)</p>
<p>Rick Leach and Jonathan Stark (U.S.) v Paul Haarhuis and</p>
<p>Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands)</p>
<p>Sunday (reverse singles)</p>
<p>Agassi v Siemerink</p>
<p>Courier v Schalken</p>
</text>
